# SCOPE 1  |  minima, re-optimised to TightOpt and analysed by FREQ at the Tier 2 level
# State: H3VO4 reference  |  register row: h3vo4-T2-V02
# Why: second half of the vanadium reference zero E(cluster) + E(H3VO4).
# Gate: ORCA TERMINATED NORMALLY, convergence string present, 0 imaginary modes.

! B3LYP D3BJ def2-TZVP RIJCOSX def2/J TightSCF DefGrid3 Opt Freq TightOpt

%pal nprocs 4 end
%maxcore 3000

%scf
  MaxIter 300
end

%freq
  Temp 298.15, 1003.15
end

* xyzfile 0 1 xyz/h3vo4.xyz
